1
00:00:03,799 --> 00:00:04,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:05,511 --> 00:00:08,889
<c.simplifiedchinese>别用这种眼神看着我 拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:09,728 --> 00:00:15,108
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说要杀我那时的眼神更好</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:16,658 --> 00:00:19,911
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的本性果然还是个刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:19,998 --> 00:00:22,834
<c.simplifiedchinese>同是刽子手的我不会说错</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:26,466
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手到死都是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:30,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为不了其他的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:30,895 --> 00:00:34,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个浪客能当多久</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:35,153 --> 00:00:37,781
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会在地狱深处好好见证的</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:41,917 --> 00:00:46,129
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫 在地狱深处好好看着吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:46,968 --> 00:00:49,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算本性是刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:50,016 --> 00:00:52,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会用余生来压制给你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:59,076 --> 00:01:03,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下到死为止
都要做一个不杀人的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:01:03,794 --> 00:01:04,962
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:01:05,588 --> 00:01:06,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:23,249 --> 00:01:26,085
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:47,584 --> 00:02:48,752
<c.simplifiedchinese>站住</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:50,757 --> 00:02:53,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住 该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:56,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:58,897
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在哪啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:58,982 --> 00:03:00,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>在这里吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:02,489 --> 00:03:03,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:05,244 --> 00:03:06,287
<c.simplifiedchinese>该不会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:06,371 --> 00:03:08,999
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心和左之助一起出去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:09,962 --> 00:03:12,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>-真的吗？
-我干嘛骗你？</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:12,675 --> 00:03:13,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:13,887 --> 00:03:17,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为他这次又离开去流浪了</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:17,393 --> 00:03:18,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:18,854 --> 00:03:21,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>你呀 是不是太爱操心了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:21,945 --> 00:03:24,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>干脆给剑心脖子上栓个链子得了</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:25,076 --> 00:03:28,412
<c.simplifiedchinese>主人和她的宠物剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:28,499 --> 00:03:30,000
<c.simplifiedchinese>汪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:31,004 --> 00:03:33,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>-讨厌…
-“讨厌”什么啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:33,969 --> 00:03:37,180
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们到底去哪里了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:37,267 --> 00:03:38,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个叫集英屋的饭馆</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:38,937 --> 00:03:41,523
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说那里今天有家赌场开门</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:41,608 --> 00:03:43,485
<c.simplifiedchinese>赌场？</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:44,781 --> 00:03:46,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 下注吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:46,785 --> 00:03:48,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>赌一赌是单还是双</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:48,456 --> 00:03:49,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:50,334 --> 00:03:53,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>-单还是双？
-五和六 单</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:53,090 --> 00:03:54,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>-大概
-单！</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:54,885 --> 00:03:55,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>开…</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:57,056 --> 00:03:58,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>五和六 单！</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:59,019 --> 00:04:01,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不愧是飞天御剑流啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:01,356 --> 00:04:03,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>看得分毫不差</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:03,652 --> 00:04:06,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说有重要的事我才来的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:06,408 --> 00:04:09,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 赌博可是违法的</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:09,581 --> 00:04:11,082
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这什么话？</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:11,168 --> 00:04:14,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>你那把逆刃刀不也是违法的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:14,132 --> 00:04:15,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>违反废刀令</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:15,927 --> 00:04:17,762
<c.simplifiedchinese>这倒也是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:17,847 --> 00:04:22,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心 这里都是我的朋友</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:22,774 --> 00:04:26,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是出老千骗钱的那种</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:26,406 --> 00:04:28,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是朋友间随便玩玩小赌怡情</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:29,037 --> 00:04:30,080
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:30,164 --> 00:04:33,543
<c.simplifiedchinese>来都来了 就玩得尽兴点吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:33,629 --> 00:04:35,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再闷闷不乐了</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:38,055 --> 00:04:42,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫的死 你从薰小姐那听说了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:42,105 --> 00:04:44,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:45,069 --> 00:04:46,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>摇骰子了</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:47,073 --> 00:04:49,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>更重要的是 下一局押什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:04:49,411 --> 00:04:51,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>是单？是双？</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:56,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个一点 所以是双 大概吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:04:57,218 --> 00:04:59,637
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了！两个一点</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:04:59,723 --> 00:05:02,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你今天手气可真好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:02,812 --> 00:05:06,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们都很久没玩了 多少放点水啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:06,194 --> 00:05:07,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>废话少说</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:07,989 --> 00:05:11,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好输得只剩兜裆布的心理准备吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:11,288 --> 00:05:12,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:13,751 --> 00:05:15,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这小老鼠！</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:15,713 --> 00:05:19,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>以为你一个人能逃掉吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:22,185 --> 00:05:24,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然还想跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:24,356 --> 00:05:25,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:25,483 --> 00:05:26,817
<c.simplifiedchinese>（饭馆 集英屋）</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:26,902 --> 00:05:30,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 卖糖的宵太怎么没来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:31,035 --> 00:05:34,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>他那么爱赌竟然没来</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:34,668 --> 00:05:36,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不知道吗 左之助？</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:05:38,634 --> 00:05:42,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>宵太这个月初去世了</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:05:43,143 --> 00:05:44,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:05:44,562 --> 00:05:46,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>是病死吗？还是意外？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:05:48,904 --> 00:05:49,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:05:51,410 --> 00:05:54,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一次抽了大量的鸦片就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:05:55,418 --> 00:05:56,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“鸦片”</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:05:56,628 --> 00:06:02,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>是一种用罂粟果实流出的乳液
干燥凝结制成的毒品</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:03,057 --> 00:06:06,144
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为会引起严重的戒断症状</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:06,231 --> 00:06:10,277
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时国家视鸦片为
必须立刻消灭的毒品</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:10,364 --> 00:06:12,783
<c.simplifiedchinese>严厉禁止</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:14,372 --> 00:06:15,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个笨蛋…</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:15,958 --> 00:06:18,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然沾染了鸦片…</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:18,755 --> 00:06:21,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是很奇怪啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:21,177 --> 00:06:23,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片价格昂贵</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:24,016 --> 00:06:27,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>如此大量的鸦片
普通人应该不太容易获得…</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:32,157 --> 00:06:33,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:37,668 --> 00:06:38,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>救救我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:06:39,046 --> 00:06:40,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:06:40,131 --> 00:06:42,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>有坏人在追我</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:06:42,553 --> 00:06:44,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>求你了 救救我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:06:45,518 --> 00:06:47,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠 你这家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:06:47,730 --> 00:06:49,232
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你还能往哪跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:06:50,361 --> 00:06:51,695
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个接着一个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:53,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们到底想干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:06:53,283 --> 00:06:55,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！少多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:06:55,329 --> 00:06:58,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>把那个女人交出来 不然…</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:00,881 --> 00:07:03,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在心里烦得很</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:03,262 --> 00:07:05,305
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话给我小心点</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:05,391 --> 00:07:09,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…你以为这么做没有后果？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:09,482 --> 00:07:12,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们是观柳先生的私兵团成员！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:12,780 --> 00:07:17,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我们作对就是与观柳先生为敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:17,163 --> 00:07:18,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>诶？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:18,249 --> 00:07:20,293
<c.simplifiedchinese>让你说话给我小心点 臭杂鱼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:20,379 --> 00:07:22,381
<c.simplifiedchinese>-观柳…
-这可不妙</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:22,466 --> 00:07:24,552
<c.simplifiedchinese>是那个武田观柳吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:24,637 --> 00:07:26,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳？</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:07:26,391 --> 00:07:28,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:07:29,814 --> 00:07:33,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>住在城郊的年轻实业家</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:07:33,447 --> 00:07:34,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>表面上是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:07:35,409 --> 00:07:37,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他私下里不知道做了什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:07:37,496 --> 00:07:40,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>在过去的几年里迅速积聚了大量财力</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:45,049
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在他在这一带豢养了大量私兵
都是一群形迹可疑的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:07:45,679 --> 00:07:50,851
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个镇里的人
从黑道到政治家都不敢跟他发生冲突</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:07:50,940 --> 00:07:55,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是观柳的私兵
那你是他的情人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:07:55,198 --> 00:07:56,199
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:07:56,993 --> 00:07:59,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>我对这些真的一无所知</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:00,459 --> 00:08:02,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>对观柳也是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:02,546 --> 00:08:05,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>撒谎可不行啊 高荷惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:13,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么…那家伙什么时候进来的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:14,696 --> 00:08:18,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为只有两个人监视就逃跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:18,412 --> 00:08:22,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实你一直被首领的手下监视着</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:25,884 --> 00:08:29,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我的确不是他的情人</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:30,351 --> 00:08:31,978
<c.simplifiedchinese>回去告诉观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:32,063 --> 00:08:34,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一定会顺利逃出去的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:08:36,906 --> 00:08:38,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可爱</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:08:38,952 --> 00:08:42,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是你还以为真能逃掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:08:43,462 --> 00:08:45,756
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你！
-赶紧给我滚！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:08:47,636 --> 00:08:48,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>知！银次！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:08:49,515 --> 00:08:51,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>穿击螺旋镖</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:08:51,770 --> 00:08:53,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才只是见面礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:08:53,648 --> 00:08:57,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来我要打烂你的双腿 惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:08:57,615 --> 00:08:59,784
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为你逃跑的惩罚</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:09,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然用榻榻米来挡！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:09,179 --> 00:09:11,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我的镖能穿过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:11,225 --> 00:09:12,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不清楚你们有什么过节…</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:16,151 --> 00:09:22,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是在下无法眼睁睁
看着别人被杀或受伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:23,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>少说大话了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:23,875 --> 00:09:26,086
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋 你对我的朋友做了什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:30,722 --> 00:09:32,516
<c.simplifiedchinese>这下真的糟了</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:32,601 --> 00:09:36,147
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳的三个私兵都被打倒了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:38,445 --> 00:09:40,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>好强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:40,366 --> 00:09:43,161
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其这位剑客简直是无敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:44,374 --> 00:09:46,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样 男孩们？</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:46,295 --> 00:09:49,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>能不能保护我逃出观柳的魔掌？</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:09:49,217 --> 00:09:52,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会重重酬谢的 好吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:55,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>先别说这个 先跟我们解释清楚</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:09:56,691 --> 00:09:59,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>-疼！
-我的两个朋友受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:09:59,697 --> 00:10:01,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>我得知道到底怎么回事</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:01,868 --> 00:10:04,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了很疼 别这么用力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:09,341 --> 00:10:10,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>是鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:10,802 --> 00:10:13,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在宵太那里也看到过这种小纸包</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:15,854 --> 00:10:19,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的报酬 难道是指这个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:28,797 --> 00:10:31,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心他们回来的好慢啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:31,468 --> 00:10:34,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来要么大赢一笔 要么大输一笔</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:34,557 --> 00:10:38,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是输的太多 可能就剩兜裆布了</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:42,825 --> 00:10:44,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要…画面太美我不想看</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:45,288 --> 00:10:46,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:46,708 --> 00:10:48,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！你回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:50,298 --> 00:10:52,466
<c.simplifiedchinese>好寒酸的房子</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:52,552 --> 00:10:53,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑术道场吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:55,516 --> 00:10:58,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 这位是高荷惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:58,815 --> 00:11:00,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我们在赌场遇见了一些麻烦…</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:00,944 --> 00:11:06,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们赢了 但是对方给不起钱
所以就用她抵债了</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:06,956 --> 00:11:09,709
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思 我们暂时得把她留在这</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:09,795 --> 00:11:12,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>懂了 所以这是满载而归</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:12,801 --> 00:11:14,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:14,889 --> 00:11:17,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我们说实话
就得把鸦片的事情告诉她们</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:17,853 --> 00:11:19,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们先暂时保密比较好</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:20,066 --> 00:11:21,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:22,487 --> 00:11:24,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说的是真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:24,992 --> 00:11:28,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也不想把小姑娘卷进来吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:30,754 --> 00:11:31,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:34,845 --> 00:11:37,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 是真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:37,810 --> 00:11:39,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看错你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:41,191 --> 00:11:43,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>人口贩卖一样的事你也参与！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:44,614 --> 00:11:47,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助就算了 连剑心你都这样！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:47,161 --> 00:11:48,663
<c.simplifiedchinese>这话什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:48,747 --> 00:11:51,875
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…高荷小姐 是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:51,963 --> 00:11:55,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>真抱歉 我会好好批评他们俩的</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:11:55,719 --> 00:11:57,346
<c.simplifiedchinese>请你回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:11:57,431 --> 00:12:00,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 我可一点都不想回家</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:00,437 --> 00:12:03,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢上他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:05,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>一刻也不想跟他分开呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:07,285 --> 00:12:12,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个浑身汗味的小姑娘
我好太多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:12,128 --> 00:12:13,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是 阿剑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:13,255 --> 00:12:15,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊！剑心 你有两把刷子嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:17,555 --> 00:12:21,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不行！这种事绝对不行！
-哎呀 为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:21,313 --> 00:12:25,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看起来不像是阿剑的恋人</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:25,821 --> 00:12:28,657
<c.simplifiedchinese>有立场说不吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:28,744 --> 00:12:30,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>快别逗她了</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:31,082 --> 00:12:33,919
<c.simplifiedchinese>这小姑娘超级单纯的</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:34,589 --> 00:12:37,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>出去！都给我出去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:40,392 --> 00:12:43,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>-哎呀呀
-真是哭笑不得</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:43,815 --> 00:12:47,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>都怪你 说些违心的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:47,823 --> 00:12:51,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 我说不想离开他是真心话</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:51,665 --> 00:12:55,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为他实力超强 对人又亲切</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:55,547 --> 00:12:59,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>待在他身边 有人来袭击的话
他一定可以保护我</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:00,099 --> 00:13:01,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心 是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:02,061 --> 00:13:04,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>你当我的护卫正合适</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:05,734 --> 00:13:09,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以倒是可以
至少让我们了解下情况吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:09,867 --> 00:13:11,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>同意</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:11,705 --> 00:13:13,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们对你还什么都不了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:14,168 --> 00:13:17,130
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为什么从观柳那里逃出来？</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:17,216 --> 00:13:20,219
<c.simplifiedchinese>他又为什么追着你不放？</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:20,306 --> 00:13:21,890
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:21,976 --> 00:13:24,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在哪里怎么得到的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:24,814 --> 00:13:27,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>粗鲁之辈才会探听女性的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:27,111 --> 00:13:28,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你！
-好了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:29,073 --> 00:13:31,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:31,161 --> 00:13:35,206
<c.simplifiedchinese>一直跟着你 总会查清鸦片的来源</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:35,294 --> 00:13:37,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>这玩意害死了我的朋友！</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:38,342 --> 00:13:42,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是还在市场上流通 我绝不饶恕</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:42,641 --> 00:13:44,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定全都干掉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:46,733 --> 00:13:47,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:48,862 --> 00:13:51,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在这啊 我到处找你</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:51,826 --> 00:13:52,911
<c.simplifiedchinese>修？</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:52,995 --> 00:13:55,706
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是带银次他们去看大夫了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:55,793 --> 00:13:58,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们没什么大事</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:13:58,799 --> 00:14:00,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>有更糟糕的事发生了</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:00,886 --> 00:14:02,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:11,366 --> 00:14:14,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是刚才观柳的私兵吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:14,497 --> 00:14:15,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>好惨</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:16,543 --> 00:14:19,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不放过让他失望的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:20,384 --> 00:14:22,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是观柳一直以来的作法</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:34,829 --> 00:14:36,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>-恶见
-是…是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:36,666 --> 00:14:39,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>打断你鼻子的那个剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:43,718
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是红色头发 脸颊有十字刀疤？</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:43,805 --> 00:14:44,806
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:46,853 --> 00:14:49,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个混蛋！惠也在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:49,317 --> 00:14:51,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好 在这把他干掉…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:51,780 --> 00:14:55,450
<c.simplifiedchinese>在公共场合引起骚动会有点麻烦啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:55,537 --> 00:14:56,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>收手</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:57,040 --> 00:14:59,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:59,754 --> 00:15:02,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管他是什么人 都不是泛泛之辈</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:02,676 --> 00:15:06,263
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见 你一个人不是对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:06,351 --> 00:15:11,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然他们在这里 般若你也在吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:12,488 --> 00:15:13,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>在</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>查清楚他们的住处了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:16,830 --> 00:15:17,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>查到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:18,082 --> 00:15:22,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人感觉敏锐很难跟踪</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:23,385 --> 00:15:25,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>-但我还是设法找到了
-很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:25,973 --> 00:15:30,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见负责夺回高荷惠 你也去帮忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:31,024 --> 00:15:32,484
<c.simplifiedchinese>也通知火男</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:33,070 --> 00:15:34,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:34,155 --> 00:15:35,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着 恶见</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:35,951 --> 00:15:37,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们两个会协助你</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:38,290 --> 00:15:40,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能再忍受任何失败</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:40,961 --> 00:15:43,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>铭记在心 告辞…</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:45,721 --> 00:15:51,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>给他们第二次机会
你还真是宽宏大量</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:51,399 --> 00:15:54,360
<c.simplifiedchinese>-是吗？
-是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:54,447 --> 00:15:56,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:57,494 --> 00:15:59,955
<c.simplifiedchinese>我骨子里是个商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:00,792 --> 00:16:05,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>不赶紧除掉没用的东西我就难受</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:06,971 --> 00:16:12,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>安全处理掉 心里就会十分爽快</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:13,318 --> 00:16:14,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何…</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:14,737 --> 00:16:17,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠带来了不少麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:18,954 --> 00:16:25,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>至关重要的下金蛋的鹅
绝不能让她跑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:27,095 --> 00:16:28,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:28,848 --> 00:16:30,433
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:30,519 --> 00:16:33,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 那个戴眼镜的男人就是观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:33,566 --> 00:16:36,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 站在他右边的是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:36,948 --> 00:16:39,450
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你有什么头绪吗？
-没有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:40,162 --> 00:16:43,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>-观柳私兵团的团长吗？
-不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:44,212 --> 00:16:46,256
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是…首领！</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:46,926 --> 00:16:49,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不属于私兵团</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:49,264 --> 00:16:52,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>是观柳最近雇来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:53,147 --> 00:16:55,816
<c.simplifiedchinese>原密探组织御庭番众的首领</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:56,863 --> 00:16:58,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>所谓“密探”</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:58,366 --> 00:17:01,953
<c.simplifiedchinese>是指活跃在江户时代的秘密间谍</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:02,833 --> 00:17:06,086
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天被称作“忍者”</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:08,551
<c.simplifiedchinese>其中御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:08,636 --> 00:17:11,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>是将军直属的谍报机关</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:11,224 --> 00:17:15,896
<c.simplifiedchinese>由许多擅长隐秘战斗技能的人组成</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:17,446 --> 00:17:19,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人临近明治维新</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:19,157 --> 00:17:22,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>年仅15岁
就成为了江户城御庭番众的首领</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:27,919
<c.simplifiedchinese>是位天才密探 名为四乃森苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:30,096 --> 00:17:33,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>他这样的人为什么会给观柳效力？</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:33,478 --> 00:17:34,771
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:34,855 --> 00:17:35,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:35,982 --> 00:17:39,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的敌人是可疑的商人
和危险的御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:40,450 --> 00:17:44,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不能丢下惠小姐不管…</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:45,126 --> 00:17:47,169
<c.simplifiedchinese>红发 十字刀疤…</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:48,048 --> 00:17:49,007
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:54,770 --> 00:17:58,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说
观柳的私兵团大概有六十人</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:58,862 --> 00:18:00,905
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对吧？
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:00,991 --> 00:18:02,784
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:02,870 --> 00:18:05,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>大概五、六人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:06,711 --> 00:18:10,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>下个问题
惠小姐你在哪里得到的鸦片？</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:12,681 --> 00:18:16,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片的事还是一直闭口不谈吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:16,229 --> 00:18:20,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>我告诉你这些是帮你们制定作战计划</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:20,321 --> 00:18:22,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片的事与此无关</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:22,701 --> 00:18:26,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其问东问西 不如除掉他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:27,293 --> 00:18:28,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:28,713 --> 00:18:31,507
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果真的跟御庭番众交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:31,594 --> 00:18:34,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕他们也没有胜算</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:34,474 --> 00:18:36,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能再继续呆在这里了</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:36,144 --> 00:18:40,607
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁着他们忙着战斗 我就逃得远远的</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:40,695 --> 00:18:42,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐 那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:42,950 --> 00:18:45,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>都说了别再问我了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:45,664 --> 00:18:48,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>听人家墙角可不好啊 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:48,252 --> 00:18:50,254
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:50,339 --> 00:18:53,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>回来之后
他们两个人就一直在房里独处！</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:53,220 --> 00:18:55,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:55,432 --> 00:18:58,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是你想的那样</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:58,438 --> 00:18:59,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是怎么回事啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:00,568 --> 00:19:02,946
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是他的本性</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:03,783 --> 00:19:09,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>看见别人有难就不能袖手旁观</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:09,335 --> 00:19:11,504
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是他的浪客天性</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:12,341 --> 00:19:14,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>他作为剑客非常坚强</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:14,512 --> 00:19:16,889
<c.simplifiedchinese>但跟人相处就很心软</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:17,518 --> 00:19:19,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是对女人和小孩</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:20,524 --> 00:19:21,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>说得也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:21,819 --> 00:19:24,905
<c.simplifiedchinese>-那左之助你也是一样吗？
-怎么可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:24,992 --> 00:19:27,411
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只想帮我朋友报仇而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:27,496 --> 00:19:30,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个狐狸女会怎么样我才不关心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:31,421 --> 00:19:35,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿左 没有异常吧？
-没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:35,179 --> 00:19:37,890
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是观柳一派的组织结构图</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:37,976 --> 00:19:39,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:40,189 --> 00:19:42,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然御庭番众也牵涉其中</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:42,652 --> 00:19:45,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们可能已经查到了这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:45,992 --> 00:19:47,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不能大意</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:48,706 --> 00:19:49,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:19:50,042 --> 00:19:55,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>详情暂时还不能透露
不过这里可能会发生一些骚动</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:19:56,304 --> 00:19:59,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫那次的失败
在下不会再犯第二次</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:19:59,937 --> 00:20:02,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 在下一定护你周全</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:05,072 --> 00:20:06,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:09,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>但等一切结束后 要跟我好好解释</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:20:13,505 --> 00:20:16,049
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听到了 剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:17,012 --> 00:20:19,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>要发生骚动是不是？</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:19,267 --> 00:20:22,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦 你什么时候…
-从昨晚开始</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:20:22,774 --> 00:20:24,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>我都没注意…</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:20:24,485 --> 00:20:27,947
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 为什么把我排除在外？</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:20:28,034 --> 00:20:29,953
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也是剑心组的一员！</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:20:30,038 --> 00:20:31,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是啥？</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:20:31,708 --> 00:20:33,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候成立这种组织了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:20:33,253 --> 00:20:35,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个小屁孩口气还挺大！</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:20:35,842 --> 00:20:39,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！你也好意思说我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:20:39,808 --> 00:20:41,685
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才是第一个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:20:44,650 --> 00:20:46,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是这种地方像个小屁孩</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:20:46,989 --> 00:20:47,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里像！</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:20:50,078 --> 00:20:51,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:20:51,539 --> 00:20:52,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>在门口！</c.simplifiedchinese>

351
00:21:02,478 --> 00:21:04,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>是御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

352
00:21:05,692 --> 00:21:08,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>乖乖地把惠交出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

353
00:21:08,573 --> 00:21:11,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还能放你们一马</c.simplifiedchinese>

354
00:22:45,892 --> 00:22:48,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《御庭番众强袭》</c.simplifiedchinese>

